/T (However, this growing reliance on GraphQL underscores the need to address its security risks. Protecting GraphQL APIs is essential to protect sensitive data and ensure application integrity. Security vulnerabilities such as unauthorized access, data exposure, and denial-of-service attacks can lead to data breaches and system downtime. )
/E (However, this growing reliance on GraphQL underscores the need to address its security risks. Protecting GraphQL APIs is essential to protect sensitive data and ensure application integrity. Security vulnerabilities such as unauthorized access, data exposure, and denial-of-service attacks can lead to data breaches and system downtime. )
