/S /P
/ActualText (The analysis of GraphQL APIs reveals significant adoption alongside considerable security challenges, with unrestricted resource consumption and security misconfigurations being prominent issues. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
578 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It shows that securing GraphQL APIs requires a detailed understanding of their unique features and potential vulnerabilities. Meanwhile, traditional security tools do not have proper support for the technology yet. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
579 0 obj
<<
